      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would be really useful, both for quick things needed to be said to a friend as well as for moderation purposes if a world owner or person in charge of a group needs to speak to someone without calling them out in front of everyone.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-06-18T14:56:24.969Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When being in a crowded room, even with voice prioritization it can be hard to talk about certain things, and you also dont want to leave the world your in a for a short exchange.\n\nA whisper feature that would let you mute everyone but the one player or a select few would help with isolating and being able to talk when necessary.\n\nSo far the alternative has been either leaving worlds or if your in one that has seperate rooms you can lock, then use that.\n\nFor the small occasions where that wouldnt be necessary, it would be quicker and easier to just isolate talk privately for a few seconds if necesary.",
